<section id="genome-decomposition-and-k-mer-counting" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="genome-decomposition-and-k-mer-counting">Genome Decomposition and K-mer Counting</h2>
<p>In this step, we break down the genome sequence into its substrings of length <em>k</em> while keeping count of each unique substring. The <code>bionumpy</code> library provides the functionality for loading FASTA files and computng <em>k</em>-mer frequencies.</p>
<div id="b2a2f5df" class="cell" data-execution_count="3">
